      "punte": [
        "fix: [taal] in 'Een van sy afdelings is Fisika.': 'Sy' could refer to Alfred Nobel or to the prize.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'sommige van Tesla se idees vroeër as Marconi s'n was': Tesla is named for the first time here with no word on who he was, so a Grade 4 reader meets an unexplained name; fixing it would add content, so it is not changed.",
