    "fix: [taal] in 'Elke sein was net 'n eenvoudige sein': 'Elke sein was net 'n eenvoudige sein' is a tautology that says nothing about what the signal was.",
    "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Dit stuur 'n boodskap as golwe sonder enige draad tussen die twee mens': 'Die twee mense' has not been introduced; the paragraph spoke of a carrier and of a wire between two places, so it is unclear which two people are meant. Fixing it means choosing content (for example who sends and who receives), so it is flagged rather than changed."
